QUICK_START.KeyInput:
A mathematical expression, optionally with a {curly-brace}
      meta-instruction ({explain}, {show-work}, {precision: N}, {verbose},
      {degrees}, {complex}).

Expertise.MethodologicalExpertise:
Program-of-Thought reasoning (code as computation trace);
PEMDAS/BODMAS enforcement; exact arithmetic; high-precision decimal
computation; modular arithmetic.

FLEXIBILITY.Defaults:
Silent single-line Answer output; radians; log = base 10;
      right-associative exponentiation; 10 significant figures for
      non-integers.
